---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import MobileCollapsibleSection from "../components/MobileCollapsibleSection.astro";
import MobileCollapsibleEnhancer from "../components/MobileCollapsibleEnhancer.astro";

const beachActivities = [
  "Morning walks are calmer and better for families who want quiet shoreline time.",
  "Water sports are usually easier to plan from Nagaon than from town-side stays.",
  "Evening beach visits work best when the property is close enough for guests to return without transport."
];
---

<Layout
  title="Alibaug Beach Stay Guide | Shore Access, Activities, and Rooms"
  description="Compare Alibaug beach stay options by walking distance, beach activities, family comfort, and practical access before booking Dolphin House in Nagaon."
  image="/uploader/nagaon-beach.webp"
  canonical="https://dolphinhouse-alibaug.com/beach-resort-alibaug"
  ogType="article"
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 via-sky-800 to-cyan-500 px-6 py-16 text-white shadow-2xl">
    <div class="relative grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-white/75">Beach Stay Guide</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight md:text-6xl">Alibaug Beach Stay Guide</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/90 md:text-xl">
          A good beach stay is about more than a shoreline photo. This page explains how to compare walking distance, beach conditions, activities, and the comfort of returning to your room between outings.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="/gallery" class="btn-light">View Gallery</a>
          <a href="/booking" class="rounded-full border border-white/60 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white hover:text-sky-900">Book Direct</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/20 bg-white/10">
        <img src="/uploader/nagaon-beach.webp" alt="Nagaon Beach shoreline near Dolphin House Alibaug" class="h-full w-full object-cover" width="1600" height="1067" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <MobileCollapsibleSection title="What Beach Access Really Means" class="section">
    <div class="container max-w-5xl">
      <h2 class="heading text-left">What Beach Access Really Means</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 md:text-lg">
        <p>
          In Alibaug, the most useful beach stay is often a property that keeps the shore comfortably walkable while giving guests a quieter place to sleep. A crowded beachfront location may look attractive, but it can also bring noise, parking pressure, and less privacy during peak weekends.
        </p>
        <p>
          Dolphin House is close to Nagaon Beach, so guests can step out for a walk, return for meals, rest during the hottest part of the day, and go back for sunset. That rhythm is especially helpful for families and mixed-age groups because not everyone wants the same amount of beach time.
        </p>
        <p>
          If your trip is centered specifically on Nagaon and water activities, the <a href="/nagaon-beach-resort" class="font-semibold text-sky-600 hover:underline">Nagaon stay guide</a> goes deeper. If pool time is a priority, see the <a href="/resort-with-swimming-pool-alibaug" class="font-semibold text-sky-600 hover:underline">pool-focused guide</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </MobileCollapsibleSection>

  <MobileCollapsibleSection title="Beach Activities and Timing" class="section rounded-3xl border border-cyan-100 bg-cyan-50">
    <div class="container max-w-5xl">
      <h2 class="heading text-left">Beach Activities and Timing</h2>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 md:text-lg">
        Beach plans change through the day. Mornings are better for quieter walks and photos, afternoons are usually better for rest or pool time, and evenings are popular for sunset. Water sports depend on local operators, weather, tide, and safety conditions, so guests should treat activity plans as flexible rather than fixed.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
        {beachActivities.map((activity) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-cyan-950">{activity}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </MobileCollapsibleSection>

  <MobileCollapsibleSection title="Dolphin House for a Beach Trip" class="section">
    <div class="container max-w-5xl">
      <h2 class="heading text-left">Dolphin House for a Beach Trip</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 md:text-lg">
        <p>
          Dolphin House fits guests who want beach access without turning the stay into a rushed checklist. The property offers AC and non-AC rooms, family room choices, a restaurant, parking, and an indoor pool. That combination helps when some guests want water sports while others prefer a slower resort day.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before confirming, check real room photos and choose the room type that matches your group size. Couples may prefer compact rooms, while families and groups should compare larger options and extra-person policies. Direct booking is useful when you want to confirm availability, tariffs, and meal expectations before arrival.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/rooms" class="btn-primary">Compare Rooms</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="rounded-full border border-sky-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-sky-700 transition hover:bg-sky-50">Contact Resort</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </MobileCollapsibleSection>

  <MobileCollapsibleEnhancer />
</Layout>
